	<item>
		<title><![CDATA[How to Plan a Two-Week Multi-Country Trip]]></title>
		<link>https://example.com/how-to-plan-a-two-week-multi-country-trip/</link>
		<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://example.com/?p=3015</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Start with the season, not the map. Weather and local festivals decide which cities are worth your limited days.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Group destinations by region to avoid backtracking, and keep at least one unscheduled day per week for rest.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Book long-haul flights and key hotels first, then fill in local transport once your dates are fixed.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

]]></content:encoded>
