		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Choose one colour palette so every item pairs with every other. Roll clothes, use packing cubes and carry a small first-aid kit.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

